			"originalText": "- the idea is that, in that 100ms of time slot\nwill be shared across all of the containers that\nneeds some % of time on that core",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "LUwEiUDz",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -4645.094073232791,
			"y": 569.9534606811527,
			"width": 993.9063889134094,
			"height": 155.68503098140727,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b0o",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 975729291,
			"version": 1310,
			"versionNonce": 262809509,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768406725826,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- so, if we say that a particular container needs\n25% of CPU/Core, we mean that, out of 100ms\nour container would need 25ms of core ",
			"fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- so, if we say that a particular container needs\n25% of CPU/Core, we mean that, out of 100ms\nour container would need 25ms of core ",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "Amq22kZi",
			"type": "text",
