			"updated": 1768407002515,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Matching number of threads\nwith number of cores in Go",
			"fontSize": 101.80278949164705,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Matching number of threads\nwith number of cores in Go",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "j1gyJY28",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -4494.6589363900675,
			"y": 2643.2977134089083,
			"width": 993.9063889134094,
			"height": 51.89501032713576,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1X",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 366892235,
			"version": 939,
			"versionNonce": 63609451,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768407081384,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- else, we are going to get trouble",
			"fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- else, we are going to get trouble",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "KO3tfXeA",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -4494.192146746244,
			"y": 2713.65949068037,
			"width": 993.9063889134094,
			"height": 207.58004130854303,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1Y",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1715609899,
			"version": 1164,
			"versionNonce": 793516805,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768410805807,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- if we have more threads than cores, we have\nmore context switches, thus loosing lot of\ninstructions that could possibly be executed\nduring those context switches",
			"fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- if we have more threads than cores, we have\nmore context switches, thus loosing lot of\ninstructions that could possibly be executed\nduring those context switches",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "3fTghWZt",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -4507.864890978108,
			"y": 2936.4329434099823,
			"width": 993.9063889134094,
			"height": 155.68503098140727,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1Z",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1224565861,
			"version": 1324,
			"versionNonce": 1531265131,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768410884711,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- thus, it is super important to match\nGOMAXPROCS with the number of cores we are\nusing",
			"fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- thus, it is super important to match\nGOMAXPROCS with the number of cores we are\nusing",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "xAEsqRwe",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -4511.015820375492,
			"y": 3113.609855085477,
			"width": 993.9063889134094,
			"height": 103.79002065427152,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1a",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1495993413,
			"version": 1484,
			"versionNonce": 1812891275,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768410997364,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- if we use anything <= 1000m, we should always\nrun our Go program as a single thread",
			"fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- if we use anything <= 1000m, we should always\nrun our Go program as a single thread",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "Z2MQIDZV",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -4509.097783281739,
			"y": 3235.5490172809696,
			"width": 993.9063889134094,
			"height": 155.68503098140727,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1b",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1016151531,
			"version": 1642,
			"versionNonce": 1226445637,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768411058215,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- if we use anything <= 2000m, we can run as a\n2 threaded go program, since we can use\npotentially two cores at the same time",
			"fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- if we use anything <= 2000m, we can run as a\n2 threaded go program, since we can use\npotentially two cores at the same time",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "JhhaaAcL",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2596.061692533386,
			"y": 2248.2670319196295,
			"width": 1277.165944743068,
			"height": 287.03945360322183,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1c",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1014544971,
			"version": 1459,
			"versionNonce": 636723051,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768412745386,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- If each service is running as a single threaded program, and we\nhad CPU affinity (which we don't), we could simplify our\nvisualization of 4 service running on a 2 CPU node sharing time like\nthis. With this configuration, we are leveraging CPUs with maximum\nefficiency. Context switches only take place when it's deemed\nnecessary",
			"fontSize": 38.27192714709624,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- If each service is running as a single threaded program, and we\nhad CPU affinity (which we don't), we could simplify our\nvisualization of 4 service running on a 2 CPU node sharing time like\nthis. With this configuration, we are leveraging CPUs with maximum\nefficiency. Context switches only take place when it's deemed\nnecessary",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
