			"locked": false,
			"text": "service 5",
			"fontSize": 24.457171117758705,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "service 5",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "xR1xXsWq",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2633.7876057841154,
			"y": 2940.0551592047545,
			"width": 1072.2651101602899,
			"height": 80.3295224621015,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1x",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1578660971,
			"version": 1707,
			"versionNonce": 691609541,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768412265171,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "In reality however, there's no CPU affinity and threads are subject\nto 10ms time slices.",
			"fontSize": 32.131808984840596,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "In reality however, there's no CPU affinity and threads are subject\nto 10ms time slices.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "vBseoNTb",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2635.3421936800582,
			"y": 3041.0074415702275,
			"width": 1072.2651101602899,
			"height": 160.659044924203,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1y",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1250100203,
			"version": 1907,
			"versionNonce": 1659559717,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768412265171,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "This means the full configured time for every cycle\n    - could be spent on any CPU \nand when or which CPU that happens on \n    - will change on every cycle",
			"fontSize": 32.131808984840596,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "This means the full configured time for every cycle\n    - could be spent on any CPU \nand when or which CPU that happens on \n    - will change on every cycle",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "AVywwGtU",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -2625.5790660411712,
			"y": 3227.4378353245847,
			"width": 1072.2651101602899,
			"height": 80.3295224621015,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1z",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 407118789,
			"version": 2083,
			"versionNonce": 854438533,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768412265171,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "The key here is that k8s will allow service-1 to always have 125ms\nof time on a CPU when it's needed, on every cycle",
			"fontSize": 32.131808984840596,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "The key here is that k8s will allow service-1 to always have 125ms\nof time on a CPU when it's needed, on every cycle",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "Cn5V50mj",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -6503.50372462642,
			"y": 1369.2067994512715,
			"width": 430.96163142650175,
			"height": 50,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#e03131",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b20",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 606998277,
			"version": 593,
			"versionNonce": 1629431407,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768420354847,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- at the end of the day, the Go program is\na CPU bound program",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- at the end of the day, the Go program is\na CPU bound program",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "M2aNOzyT",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -6510.921775075324,
			"y": 1619.925077282376,
			"width": 448.7679359829522,
			"height": 75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b20V",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1147365839,
			"version": 933,
			"versionNonce": 193323727,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768420057125,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- use decent no.of cores, but not too much,\nfor a CPU Bound go program, and a core or\nless for a IO Bound go program",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- use decent no.of cores, but not too much, for a CPU Bound go program, and a core or less for a IO Bound go program",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": "- use decent no.of cores, but not too much, for a CPU Bound go program, and a core or less for a IO Bound go program"
		},
		{
			"id": "sj1ZbZvd",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -6517.706946874647,
			"y": 1714.775796113598,
			"width": 448.7679359829522,
			"height": 150,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#e03131",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b20l",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 209720769,
			"version": 973,
			"versionNonce": 176006703,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768420343328,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- you never want more OS threads than you\nhave cores when running CPU bound\nworkloads. Having more OS threads than you\nhave cores will cause extra context switches\nthat will slow down your program from getting\napplication work done.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- you never want more OS threads than you have cores when running CPU bound workloads. Having more OS threads than you have cores will cause extra context switches that will slow down your program from getting application work done.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": "- you never want more OS threads than you have cores when running CPU bound workloads. Having more OS threads than you have cores will cause extra context switches that will slow down your program from getting application work done."
		},
		{
			"id": "uWviikS3",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -6504.844635885614,
			"y": 1432.682869815487,
			"width": 430.96163142650175,
			"height": 175,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b21",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 104712613,
			"version": 946,
			"versionNonce": 1039212513,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1768416397972,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- if we will be needing 25% or less than a\nfull core % of CPU, then our go program\nshould be running as a single threaded go\nprogram\n- because it is only ever using a single CPU\nin a clock cycle, and we don't want to have\nmore threads than number of cores",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- if we will be needing 25% or less than a\nfull core % of CPU, then our go program\nshould be running as a single threaded go\nprogram\n- because it is only ever using a single CPU\nin a clock cycle, and we don't want to have\nmore threads than number of cores",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "OyZE3KhX",
			"type": "text",
